        "original_id": "4bf530a7-3b8f-5117-b7f8-ed5a7a349ec7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chantal Claret, Chantal Claret Euringer, Max Green, Maxwell Scott Green, Pedro Yanowitz\n- Organizations: Morningwood, Escape the Fate, The Natural Born Killers\n- Roles: singer/songwriter, musician, bassist, backing vocalist, rhythm guitarist, vocalist, founder\n\nFacts:\n- Chantal Claret Euringer was born on February 21, 1982, and she is known professionally as Chantal Claret.\n- Chantal Claret is an American singer/songwriter.\n- Morningwood was founded in 2001, and it primarily consisted of Pedro Yanowitz and Chantal Claret.\n- Maxwell Scott Green was born on December 15, 1984, and he is better known as Max Green.\n- Max Green is an American musician.\n- Max Green was one of the founders of Escape the Fate and served as its bassist and backing vocalist.\n- Max Green was also the former rhythm guitarist and vocalist for The Natural Born Killers.",
